            "text": "<p>Sprout was the fabric selected from our <a href=\"https://www.monteirofabrics.com/pages/chance-collection\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.monteirofabrics.com/pages/chance-collection\">Chance Collection</a> for the Luna interior design McDonald's projects. This collection boasts fabrics with an <strong>abrasion resistance of ≥ 400,000 Martindale cycles </strong>(ISO 5470-2). Chance Sprout adds exceptional durability along with a unique touch of elegance, pleasant texture, and a fun aesthetic, perfectly complementing the iconic design of the McDonald's brand.</p>",
